  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Finance Resource Centre (PFRC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PFRC offers technical assistance to ODA eligible countries in the fields of tax, public financial management (PFM) and broader macro-fiscal work, including debt management. The PFRC is intended to mobilise flexible technical assistance more quickly than is currently available, responding to clear demand for such support from partner countries.

The PFRC is one of 3 pillars of the UK Centre of Expertise for Public Finance to help partner countries access technical expertise.</narrative>
  </description>
